  "details": "<p><em>PECS</em> notes that the necropolis lies some 6km east of Randazzo, Sicily. Excavated in the nineteenth century, the archaeological materials are held in the Vagliasindi Museum in Randazzo and at the national museums of Siracusa and Palermo.</p>",
